      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Five Row States",
      "items": [
        "Status precedence: not_implemented > not_applicable > unknown > estimated > measured",
        "Unknown rows stay visible with a measure path; they never become a silent zero",
        "N/A requires structural proof, not a failed lookup"
      ]
