      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Kill-Switches Beat Averages",
      "items": [
        "A proven gate caps the band at High while keeping the honest score",
        "A gate with no graded source row is unevaluable, never counted as clear",
        "Suppression outranks capping: no number means no cap disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two Denominators",
      "items": [
        "Frozen (default): unknown stays in the denominator as disclosed unscored",
